      <chord name="Cm"/>For <chord name="F7"/>her <chord name="Gm"/>Lord now <chord name="Cm"/>liveth; <chord name="F"/>Death has <chord name="F7"/>lost <chord name="Bb"/>its sting.
      </lines>
